Description Task 15: Copy custom manifests from {{ item }} to {{ rke2_data_path }}/server/manifests/ with owner root, group root, and mode 0644.

Task 16: Copy Static Pods
Description Task 16: Copy static pods from {{ item }} to {{ rke2_data_path }}/agent/pod-manifests/ with owner root, group root, and mode 0644.

